# CI/CD (dental_booking)

- **VPS / single-server default:** local **`docker build`** then interactive **`docker login`** + **`docker push`** to Docker Hub — **`scripts/docker_hub_release.ps1`** / **`docker_hub_release.sh`**; docs **`CI_CD.md`**, **`documentation/VPS_IMAGE_AND_DATA.md`**.
- **Optional Hub push from GitHub Actions:** **`.github/workflows/docker-hub-publish.yml`** — **`workflow_dispatch`** or **git tag `v*`**; needs **`DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`** / **`DOCKERHUB_TOKEN`** secrets; build steps run **before** login (no push on build failure).
- **No-secrets image verify:** **`.github/workflows/docker-images-build-verify.yml`** (`push: false`).
- **Corporate pipeline:** **Jenkins** (`Jenkinsfile`) → **GHCR** for image publish + deploy when Jenkins is the org standard.
- **GitHub Actions:** supplementary PR checks; not a substitute for Jenkins unless the team does not use Jenkins.

Canonical docs: **`CI_CD.md`**, **`AGENTS.md`**, **`README.md`** (CI section).
